      <activity id="e2383d5a-589f-5e5e-8604-6a907b0ae447" activityNameId="af1bc259-8723-5f6d-9f64-384c0992c95e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, at nuclear power plant, allocation exergy</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, at nuclear power plant, allocation exergy
Inventory for 1 MJ heat from nuclear power plant. In 2019, of the total energy produced were 97.8% as electricity and 2.2% as heat. The exergy factor is 1 for ectricity and 0.170 for heat. This leads to the allocation factor of 0.996 for electricity an 0.004 for heat.;
UUID: b9f7599f-a119-343b-97a9-dd29a6999a80
Included is the demnd of materials, energy, infrastructures and transports for the production of heat at a nuclear power plant
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b9f7599f-a119-343b-97a9-dd29a6999a80.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
